{"id":859237,"title":"07｜出海创客的财务宝典：海外公司注册与跨境支付指南","content":"注册海外公司对独立开发者而言有三大好处：提升企业形象与信任度、绕过地域限制和服务门槛、便捷实现跨境资金流动。选择注册地时，香港因地理位置便利、低税率及发达金融体系成为首选，但开户流程繁琐且国际认可度下降；新加坡政策稳定、金融服务发达，适合面向东南亚市场的企业，但成本较高；英国注册简便费用低，但在维护和运营上成本高；美国特别是怀俄明州因其无企业所得税、隐私保护好等优势受到青睐，推荐使用LLC形式。注册途径包括Stripe Atlas、First Base或淘宝等平台，其中怀俄明州通过My Agents性价比高。完成注册后，推荐使用Mercury或Brex银行开户，并申请EIN税号。对于支付通道，Stripe是最佳选择之一，支持多种本地化支付方式，集成简单；PayPal、Square及Paddle等也是不错的选择。正确选择注册地、公司类型及支付工具是出海成功的关键。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401955,"user_name":"怀揣梦想的学渣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1916685,"ip_address":"山东","ucode":"2349B9F4F6FDE3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/3f/0d/1e8dbb2c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1754750020,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100992901,"comment_content":"这一节讲的很好","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":399869,"user_name":"Geek_a6dd8d","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4116302,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"AE4354E06C6FD5","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1745641707,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100992901,"comment_content":"催更","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":399057,"user_name":"吴军旗^_^","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1507640,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"5760CE31AE3FA5","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/01/38/5daf2cfb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742997562,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100992901,"comment_content":"催更！","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":398609,"user_name":"Geek_d5f192","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4096945,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"2645325AFFB714","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741765054,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100992901,"comm